To run the rust compiler:
	rustc -o loop loop.rs
To run the program:
	./loop

To see the assembly listing:
	rustc --emit=asm loop.rs
To see the assembly listing with debug:
	rustc -g --emit=asm loop.rs
To see the assembly listing with debug and optimization:
	rustc -g --emit=asm -C opt-level=3 loop.rs
To see the assembly listing without debug and with optimization:
	rustc --emit=asm -C opt-level=3 loop.rs

You should see be able to see that the optimizer is not as good
as plain C but it does give you error checking.
